Package: merkmal
Type: Package
Title: Phonological Feature Systems and Segment Distances
Version: 0.12.0
Authors@R: person("Tiago", "Tresoldi", email = "tiago.tresoldi@lingfil.uu.se",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Maps IPA transcriptions of speech segments to phonological
    feature representations under seven feature systems, built on the
    Cross-Linguistic Transcription Systems, PHOIBLE and P-base, and computes
    dissimilarities between segments through a declared feature geometry.
    Every comparison can report its coverage, and every system has a
    semantic fingerprint that identifies stored results. Bindings to the
    merkmal C library, which is compiled into the package.
License: file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/tresoldi/merkmal, https://merkmal.tresoldi.org
BugReports: https://github.com/tresoldi/merkmal/issues
Depends: R (>= 4.1)
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Encoding: UTF-8
